.TH csaf_validator 1 "23 October 2026"
.SH NAME
csaf_validator \- validate local CSAF advisory files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcsaf_validator\fP [OPTIONS] files...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates each file against the CSAF 2.0 JSON schema and, if one is configured, against a remote validation service.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Application Options
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-version\fR\fP
Display version of the binary
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-validator\fR \fIURL\fR\fP
URL to validate documents remotely
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-validator_cache\fR \fIFILE\fR\fP
FILE to cache remote validations
.TP
\fB\fB\-\-validator_preset\fR <default: \fI"mandatory"\fR>\fP
One or more presets to validate remotely
.TP
\fB\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIAMOUNT\fR\fP
If a remote validator was used, display AMOUNT ('all', 'important' or 'short') results
.SS Help Options
.TP
\fB\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR\fP
Show this help message
